            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything Must Fall is an action-packed physics puzzle game in VR. You are an outcast among the tinies working your daily job as a demolitioner at Blow Big Stuff Up Ltd. Before you know it, your life is turned upside down. You must save your parents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLOSIONS AND DESTRUCTION!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun tools to discover and experiment with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique levels, featuring dynamites, speed ramps, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Level Editor + Workshop support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selfie stick, for the vain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLOSURE:<br> I was going to add more things to it but we lost the source files on the git repository so I cant update the game.  So I am releasing it as is, as we made it 9 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully you can have some fun in it and make some levels, if not, feel free to refund it, it should not be more than 2 hours of content anyway! <br> <br>Kind regards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carry Castle</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything Must Fall is an action-packed physics puzzle game in VR. You are an outcast among the tinies working your daily job as a demolitioner at Blow Big Stuff Up Ltd. Before you know it, your life is turned upside down. You must save your parents. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLOSIONS AND DESTRUCTION!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun tools to discover and experiment with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique levels, featuring dynamites, speed ramps, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game Level Editor + Workshop support!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A selfie stick, for the vain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLOSURE:<br> I was going to add more things to it but we lost the source files on the git repository so I cant update the game.  So I am releasing it as is, as we made it 9 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopefully you can have some fun in it and make some levels, if not, feel free to refund it, it should not be more than 2 hours of content anyway! <br> <br>Kind regards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Carry Castle</p>",
